      "message": "```suggestion\n* **Panic button**: the old panic button shipped in CalyxOS 6 was built on [Ripple](https://guardianproject.info/apps/info.guardianproject.ripple/), an app that is longer actively maintained. In July, we decided to temporarily remove this feature while we explored our community\u0027s needs and use cases in emergency situations. Since then, we have run UX research workshops and are redesigning it as a quick, reliable trigger for when you need to urgently hide or remove sensitive data, apps, and files.\n```",
